    "The menu bar icon is hidden by macOS 26.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The menu bar icon is hidden by macOS 26."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏图标被 macOS 26 挡住了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hidden icon is not a code-signing or privacy-permission issue. Picture in Picture uses Screen Recording. Controlling another display from Picture in Picture also uses Accessibility.\n\nmacOS 26 controls third-party status items here:\n\nSystem Settings → Menu Bar → Allow in the Menu Bar → enable Candela\n\nIf Candela is already enabled, turn it off and back on. If it remains hidden, use Reset Control Center at the bottom as a last resort. Resetting also restores every Control Center and menu bar layout to its defaults.\n\nIf you use Ice, Bartender, or BetterTouchTool, their menu-bar buttons can also reveal a hidden Candela item.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hidden icon is not a code-signing or privacy-permission issue. Picture in Picture uses Screen Recording. Controlling another display from Picture in Picture also uses Accessibility.\n\nmacOS 26 controls third-party status items here:\n\nSystem Settings → Menu Bar → Allow in the Menu Bar → enable Candela\n\nIf Candela is already enabled, turn it off and back on. If it remains hidden, use Reset Control Center at the bottom as a last resort. Resetting also restores every Control Center and menu bar layout to its defaults.\n\nIf you use Ice, Bartender, or BetterTouchTool, their menu-bar buttons can also reveal a hidden Candela item."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏图标被隐藏，不是代码签名或隐私权限的问题。画中画需要屏幕录制；从画中画控制另一块显示器还需要辅助功能。\n\nmacOS 26 在这里管理第三方状态栏图标：\n\n系统设置 → 菜单栏 → 允许出现在菜单栏 → 打开 Candela\n\n如果 Candela 已经打开，请先关闭再重新打开。若图标仍然隐藏，最后再使用页面底部的「重置控制中心」。重置也会将所有控制中心和菜单栏布局恢复为默认值。\n\n如果你装了 Ice / Bartender / BetterTouchTool，点它们的菜单栏按钮也能看到被收纳的 Candela。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
